Here are the direct technical details on Espie AI SGM V3.0

here are the actual core ideas/things that were actually implemented through V1.0 and 2.1 and 2.5

Wi-Fi Control ---- Simple Wi-Fi controller to add Wikipedia as an external source if it doesn't know something.
Neural net structs ---- the code defined neurons with weights, bias, and values. That's the math driven firing core.
Dataset mapping ---- Equations as stimuli, processed through the net.
Rule interceptors ---- Safety guardrails, routing math vs support vs halt.
Top-k sampler ---- Adds randomness and repetition penalty, like biological variability.
Arena allocator ---- 16 KB SRAM arena, reset each step, keeping memory lean
Flash mapping ---- 1.6M parameter dataset mapped directly from flash, no GPU, no external RAM.


